{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40602","headline":"送沈光赴福幕 · 李洞","name":"送沈光赴福幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泉齐岭鸟飞，雨熟荔枝肥。\n南斗看应近，北人来恐稀。\n潮浮廉使宴，珠照岛僧归。\n幕下逢迁拜，何官着茜衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40602.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40602","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}